---
title: Contact and quotes
description: Get a security quote from Spike Security. Call 020 3757 2767, answered 24 hours, or send the site, the dates and the hours. Office in Cheetham Hill, Manchester.
permalink: /contact.html
section: Contact
dock: false
schemaPage: business
---
{% from "macros.njk" import pagehead, faqs, map, phone %}
{% set send = "Send" if site.formEndpoint else "Open in my email app" %}
{{ pagehead("Tell us the site, the dates and the hours.", "Need cover tonight? Call " + phone(site) + ", answered 24 hours. For anything planned, send the details and we’ll reply with a price and the officers we’d send.") }}

<section class="sec sec--flush" aria-label="Get a quote">
  <div class="wrap contact">
    <div class="contact-form" id="quote">
      <h2 class="sub-title">Get a quote</h2>
      <p class="form-intro">{% if site.formEndpoint %}{{ site.replyPromise }}{% else %}This opens your email app with everything filled in, ready to send to {{ site.email }}. {{ site.replyPromise }}{% endif %}</p>
      <form class="form" data-form data-to="{{ site.email }}" data-subject="Quote request" data-endpoint="{{ site.formEndpoint }}" action="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Quote%20request" method="post" enctype="text/plain" novalidate>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>The job</legend>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="q-service">Service</label>
            <select id="q-service" name="Service" required>
              <option value="">Choose a service…</option>
              {% for s in services %}<option value="{{ s.name }}" data-slug="{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
              <option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="q-where">Where</label>
            <span class="hint" id="q-where-hint">The venue, town or postcode</span>
            <input id="q-where" name="Where" required autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="q-where-hint" placeholder="For example, Deansgate, M3…">
          </div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-dates">Dates</label>
              <span class="hint" id="q-dates-hint">One date, a range, or a pattern</span>
              <input id="q-dates" name="Dates" required autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="q-dates-hint" placeholder="For example, every Friday and Saturday…">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-hours">Hours <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
              <span class="hint" id="q-hours-hint">Start and finish</span>
              <input id="q-hours" name="Hours" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="q-hours-hint" placeholder="For example, 9pm to 3am…">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field field--short">
            <label for="q-officers">Officers <span class="opt">if you know</span></label>
            <input id="q-officers" name="Officers" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="500" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>You</legend>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-name">Your name</label>
              <input id="q-name" name="Name" autocomplete="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-company">Company <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
              <input id="q-company" name="Company" autocomplete="organization">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-phone">Phone</label>
              <span class="hint" id="q-phone-hint">So the supervisor can call you back</span>
              <input id="q-phone" class="data" name="Phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required data-phone aria-describedby="q-phone-hint">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="q-email">Email <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
              <span class="hint" id="q-email-hint">For the written quote</span>
              <input id="q-email" name="Email" type="email" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="q-email-hint">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="q-msg">Anything else <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
            <textarea id="q-msg" name="Message" rows="4" placeholder="Licence conditions, the crowd you expect, anything we should know…"></textarea>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" type="submit">{{ send }}</button>
          <p class="form-note">Prefer to talk? Call {{ phone(site) }}, any time.</p>
        </div>
        {% include "form-status.njk" %}
      </form>
    </div>

    <aside class="contact-info" aria-label="Contact details">
      <div class="ci-block">
        <h2 class="foot-h">Call, 24 hours</h2>
        <a class="ci-tel" translate="no" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
        <p>Answered {{ site.operations }}. For urgent cover, call rather than email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ci-block">
        <h2 class="foot-h">Email</h2>
        <p><a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> for quotes and questions</p>
        <p><a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.careersEmail }}">{{ site.careersEmail }}</a> for jobs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ci-block">
        <h2 class="foot-h">Office</h2>
        <address>{{ site.office.street }}<br>{{ site.office.area }}<br>{{ site.office.city }} {{ site.office.postcode }}</address>
        <p class="muted">{{ site.office.hours }}</p>
      </div>
      {{ map(site, "office", "Map showing our office on Cheetham Hill Road, Manchester") }}
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="faq-title">Questions we get asked.</h2>
    </div>
    {{ faqs([
      { q: "How quickly can you send officers?", a: site.notice },
      { q: "Are all your officers licensed?", a: "Yes. Every officer holds a valid SIA licence for their role. We check each licence before every deployment and send you the numbers before the shift." },
      { q: "Do you offer flexible contracts?", a: "Yes: short-notice one-off cover, rolling monthly agreements and long-term contracts, all set out in a written agreement." },
      { q: "Which areas do you cover?", a: "Mainly Manchester, Salford, Trafford, Stockport, Bolton and Bury, and across the North West. Further afield, call us and we’ll tell you straight away if we can cover it." }
    ]) }}
  </div>
</section>
